! flameD two-step GLOBAL mechanism — RELAXED Ea for EDC sustain
! Purpose: allow EDC / finite-rate-edm to keep a flame that EDM established.
! Ea in cal/mol. Rates intentionally easier than ch4_2step_chem.inp.
! NOT for final kinetics accuracy — ignition/sustain study only.
ELEMENTS
O  H  C  N
END
SPECIES
CH4  O2  CO2  H2O  CO  N2
END
REACTIONS
CH4+1.5O2=>CO+2H2O                          5.012E+11    0.000    20000.0
CO+0.5O2=>CO2                               2.239E+12    0.000    15000.0
END
